{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d01a89d9e11a63ff01ca2d78fdbe367e9c635b17f385bc031b128de6db15c9ec",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a763f49c3848a8561a26b9e20843f22ed692a93d5e4991df40250d721f11b2a",
      "text": "眼泪是努力的证明",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ecbc52a2acb85c437bc0686653cdce7d36f1be923f827dc09b624287c8cab4",
      "text": "志狼被学校留了很难的作业。\n虽然一开始抗拒着不想写，\n但在制作人“能解出这道题的话很帅气哦”的\n鼓励下开始动笔，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a763f49c3848a8561a26b9e20843f22ed692a93d5e4991df40250d721f11b2a",
      "text": "眼泪是努力的证明",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931f01603fc700267c0d43a190c516e2208bd5b5f7cd98e397fd4a7735a17054",
      "text": "辛苦啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5db0283c47c014161da8b6e95171e74a90e125cf3bdfed3e8447cb81aba1a8d1",
      "text": "……咦？志狼君，你怎么来了。\n今天应该没有工作安排吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9edc06b274868dfd207fe8aec1c8c924a39958a67e3899f4b40e448632ad3983",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n没啦……就是有点事！啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813e0f6dee933e225eafba71a9a8a23449ade95368033b0baeec14d17c9539c7",
      "text": "（总觉得样子有点奇怪啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102611e66ae53427f291663d52be6a42d20935e0b2feb26c30e6e1cd2e5f9967",
      "text": "难道是发生什么事了吗？\n不嫌弃的话，可以跟我讲讲哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f38c0f5875bfd72874e333cd4793e5e844afafb5ebcdb39d567b5ac6833325f",
      "text": "……唔。果然瞒不过\n●●●●プロデューサー啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab08231cdc64ca53e34e4de46564b5d26caa3c28f35e93a3308eda283df21f5a",
      "text": "那个啊，学校留了超难的作业。\n算术的……叫什么来着。应用题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1558b4c5487b05e2866703237fe9a11989813ab39b5b98910407b0f4ec1995aa",
      "text": "老师虽然说什么上课认真听了就一定能解出来～，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed572870ec9a13eae4d6e619d5a3aec78331919bf062ad8dffd6a98458d1295b",
      "text": "我上课又没认真听也根本不记得，\n绝对不可能写得出来啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f22cbac884064a978fdc4d5cd0a020359097b638a78ce10c6489e45ccfe9afa",
      "text": "所以，在被老妈问作业写了没？\n之前我就逃出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87edb4e4877e1580fba7667a8a2b16869969f3830da00d13bf9bd853f5f33b78",
      "text": "作业必须要写才行哦。要是被留校的话，\n练习的时间也会变少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc537d182c581b2e757ea4cfc48b3413682a590a67bfbacacd7e7d2c4e9dedf",
      "text": "诶——！？算术这种东西不写\n又不会死，有什么大不了的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d589541724a3b913e8162589f7904a8207dcbe956481c8293e756d724fd63e1",
      "text": "……志狼君，\n可以让我看看你的作业吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61eba08f5d913028ea348945e4d9cc77797a86b06601a788ae5172f2260afda3",
      "text": "等等哦！\n……诺，这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c0806b4e0020038831a7e35e1f65898e0c8c3775b82c5bc992d64a099727350",
      "text": "……原来如此，是稍微有点复杂的分数计算呢。\n这道题确实可能会觉得很难。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee61b022a418fcf18f44b3d692f1f6953f146b7c21f5417ff54fc07ddfa0306",
      "text": "对吧——？这种题根本不可能啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584705368abf955678d5ac52d63c5269b4e9fd75c8f8e437ec5214d5b9d516c0",
      "text": "但是，能解开这么难的题目，\n会超级帅气的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c49ceed34a9b6c3fa74cc1adb40a7de9fbf1f23a948600c9d109486ceb2bcc5",
      "text": "……帅气？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9338c049ab4d323a332d5b8f9945857db9b605cfe023fdfb4747de4a52691827",
      "text": "是的，非常帅气哦！\n克服不擅长的事物是迈向大人的第一步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03f2035d3f78bbe807cbe05c9fbc3b7e728e63382dd7506849b15b183cc8d1fa",
      "text": "要是有难懂的地方，我也会帮你的。\n首先来试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab3139c9d3544cb4c5c56e2cecfa5c7294cd2a1811a8405dd01df6f18a33711",
      "text": "真、真拿你没办法——\n既然你都说到这份上了，那我就做做看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:031f802793e1700d0ae73be2aaafff4d3d2b73b4c030714a36f0125349bf5d77",
      "text": "嗯——，那个……这里是……咦？\n好像之前在课本上见过……啊，有了有了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9319e4340ffc08b93e6c17a63557e9da7bdcc4c3c0915fde320ca65a07667a1",
      "text": "（志狼君看起来非常努力呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a54866e7418667f1e88daede872c54d2354f355906a7b9a1369af8c7952a90aa",
      "text": "（看起来非常专注，\n暂时先不打扰他了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000063:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dce8ad7958e3bfc7624b4428fdf9b22be5af601c7abae42d0211f12e8c33e761",
      "text": "（文件这样就整理好了……\n啊，已经这个时间了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a3d730e10de5add39aa4da916e9f5e5ca1e461faad006c0798fba61f3378b7e",
      "text": "（志狼君的作业怎么样了呢。\n去看看情况吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4487967188b19dcdc48328e031e46c8e57114bb2671fb5d5fa41276a7f37d25",
      "text": "志狼君，作业写得怎么样了……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41093b09b826ed6bcf31e21b09ce7a6b19471d893a87bb2fbd12fbd45d72fe4a",
      "text": "……呜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b89a63f5c54ff288c005635135523ba095bc858edcab11f663d880bd3b9597df",
      "text": "志狼君，你怎么了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb3241c95ff587f85ad13787fad3b3810d3a448ddd1a212a99da81cdabfaefe4",
      "text": "作业，全都是不会写的地方！\n可是说不会写又太丢脸了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_c:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4524937641d418d0d506a52209f0818ee3a12c9339eff3a0aebd3c8d4210e15b",
      "text": "但怎么想怎么想都不知道该怎么办，\n完全搞不懂啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7238164b53fce33d798847e7b2e7475deef5cc899d479292ca2ff4b3fe7ccf41",
      "text": "（有好多用橡皮反复擦掉重写的痕迹……\n真的拼命努力过了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0636ad594d0e172bc5e1bef121d75be59be99266632facfa001ffc330106ab8",
      "text": "……志狼君。能坚持写到现在，已经很棒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:843cf84427bc917b0b37a3dee401f8beeddc5ec092a5765bcf003585c4fd16d3",
      "text": "可是，把不明白的地方问出来，\n一点都不丢人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:615e0c054e03b0041fed8c2142a0e6902d6e153b7d0d43690cfc07cbdd3e37a5",
      "text": "……真、真的吗？可是，\n总觉得像投降了一样，超难看的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24cf27a368ada6fd68cf9b6aeb64c934d72bc0ceaf6307464bdf31d4c7c1f277",
      "text": "才没那回事呢。而且其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a339fc263dad5ddcf9d5614b6a43651146fe14852e3717869c9c3275053467",
      "text": "前几天，High×Joker的大家\n也来找我请教过作业呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6cf1ba2d75071e3e0ff93262899e45edc0a9b064de7b1ce6702ef43098bf73b",
      "text": "比志狼君年纪更大的人，遇到不懂的事\n也会向周围的人请教的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a34a1d2a2e41649990f0c72c11ed139f033c479e304afa44310fc95828c08e",
      "text": "不是丢脸的事吗……？\n……那、那个，那……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d98329a071ada7b98a20216a858dd3bef61454420f50ae447286e585ba7d80b",
      "text": "这里，教教我啦。\n我怎么想都完全搞不懂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9277882232c6f8eeacf19137dc23d8c3c66e384f74737f51947134af15fad0b7",
      "text": "当然可以。\n那个，这个是这样的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:628a912f795a9ab23d6dd046c4662d8f1799829daa99e8e8222aeea9852135ef",
      "text": "终……终于写完了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4576e566253b738788b35863a6f9428832ecce4d5a7e8da7007512c83a1ad13",
      "text": "真不愧是你，志狼君。\n辛苦你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4411522ceb83fcdcb2f648b4d683aa4a7e4b64ebf887ee22805d1dfae3fbd8",
      "text": "一开始虽然很苦恼，但最后\n基本上都是你自己解出来的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a84f5fc099a06564360d1c1283bf5cab210bf0108a6b5b959172cecdd7bafe0",
      "text": "对吧——？\n我要是认真起来也是办得到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03aac66c9d89758d48ecfb6e6e7da14543980f90e641d609944dd1e52d2813c1",
      "text": "而且……●●●●プロデューサー教得\n也超级清楚！谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a304a916338ac48f49bfe51aeb90bc36a19904a9b0584c4688ef0f878ef1fac3",
      "text": "这样就不用挨老妈骂了！\n好啦，有想看的动画所以差不多该回去啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404490ceede9bd7ae81defc6f64faa2fb0a8835c3990963f89cfeb9839786dc2",
      "text": "今天谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！\n这份人情，我会用工作来还的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac03036097c495fbc01b45c07431455051cd0bc4f2c82cc2837e336626e85126",
      "text": "呃，那叫什么，出世后付款？是叫这个吗？\n不对吗？算啦反正是那个意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0856803ed53fe365abd426b604d94a7ed7dd6fd4cd0299bebecd9133536752b3",
      "text": "那我走啦，辛苦啦！\n明天见——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efcd53c8b80d699ee02bbc413a5060f1bc9b6cc1ef4d54d9f2b77f44387a5a1a",
      "text": "好，辛苦你了。明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
